The pictures in this folder are Noto Emoji's SVGs (https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji, tag v2026-09-24-unicode18_0),
made smaller by scripts/gen-emoji.mjs (comments, metadata and editor data removed). The emoji names and
keywords in src/components/app/emoji-data.generated.ts come from Unicode's emoji-test.txt 18.0 and CLDR (release-49).

